OL,3,GNEWSALabour leader urges Greens to
OL,4,Adenounce Zionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour leader of Worcester City
OL,7,FCouncil has called on Green councillors
OL,8,Fto publicly denounce a motion that
OL,9,Fdeclared Zionism a form of racism,
OL,10,Fsaying it has "no place in society".
OL,12,FLynn Denham wants the Worcester Green
OL,13,FParty to reject the policy, which was
OL,14,Fadopted at the Greens' conference
OL,15,Fearlier this month.
OL,17,F"They need to make clear their position
OL,18,Fin rejecting the statement. This isn't
OL,19,Fan issue about party politics; it's
OL,20,Fabout what is right," she said.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
