OL,3,GNEWSALabour leader urges Greens to
OL,4,Adenounce Zionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorcester Green Party said it condemned
OL,7,F"antisemitism and all other forms of
OL,8,Fracism" and "would not take moral
OL,9,Flectures from Labour".
